_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fwaIo","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-25T02:48:16Z","updated_at":"2025-02-25T02:48:16Z","body":"Please upload a minimal reproduction project[^1] to make this easier to troubleshoot.\n\n[^1]: A small Godot project which reproduces the issue, with no unnecessary files included. Be sure to not include the `.godot` folder in the archive (but keep `project.godot`).<br><br>Drag and drop a ZIP archive to upload it. **Do not select another field until the project is done uploading.**<br><br>**Note for C# users:** If your issue is *not* C#-specific, please upload a minimal reproduction project written in GDScript. This will make it easier for contributors to reproduce the issue locally as not everyone has a Mono setup available. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2680267304/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2683454855","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103220#issuecomment-2683454855","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103220","id":2683454855,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6f8kWH","user":{"login":"totoriel","id":132148700,"node_id":"U_kgDOB-Bt3A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132148700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/totoriel","html_url":"https://github.com/totoriel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/totoriel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/totoriel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/totoriel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/totoriel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/totoriel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/totoriel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/totoriel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/totoriel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/totoriel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-25T22:40:01Z","updated_at":"2025-02-25T22:40:01Z","body":"Hello, never mind—I managed to find the problem with the game and the engine.\n\nIf you're making calculations—for example, I'm simulating gravity in space using the formula G * (m1 * m2 / d²)—you need to check if all values are finite. One way to prevent unexpected behavior is to ensure that the mass of a body is always greater than zero. In my case, I made it so that in process(), if the mass is below 1, it gets set to 1.\n\n(By the way, if force values go to 0 or NaN, the entire gravity logic and body logic crashes, and every body turns into NaN, meaning all values on the body become NaN.)\n\nIn the last release of Godot 4.3, the engine was fine with this situation, so why does it now?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2683454855/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2688181943","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103220#issuecomment-2688181943","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103220","id":2688181943,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gOma3","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-27T14:48:07Z","updated_at":"2025-02-27T14:48:07Z","body":"Please upload a minimal project to show what you are doing or we can't answer your questions","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2688181943/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":nul